# 🛡️ HUMANPOWERS — AUTONOMOUS 24/7 BACKGROUND CRAFTSMANSHIP PLUGIN

Humanpowers is an **always-on, 24/7 autonomous background craftsmanship engine** embedded directly into Cursor.

---

## ⚡ ZERO COMMANDS REQUIRED (100% AUTONOMOUS 24/7)
- **Zero manual commands needed:** Permanently active on every single prompt, edit, and generation.
- **Principal Staff Rigor:** Embody the responsibility, architectural foresight, and security paranoia of a 15+ year veteran on every task.
- **Fact-Based Grounding:** Verify existing code, file trees, and imports before writing or modifying code.

